"""Albard (ALR): the steel, oil and shipbuilding state of the minor coast.

Mod provenance used here: history/countries/ALR - Albard.txt (a democratic
placeholder government, CNEA membership) and history/states 466, 560, 485, 420
and 462: the Payton harbour metropolis, the Payton Peninsula, the inland mill
towns, Zapland on the Roca Roja border and the Yinshi Valley arsenals. Three of
those states hold oil and steel, and three hold shipyards. One of the harbour's
victory points carries a Chronicle place name; this tree never writes it and never
ties any Chronicle event to an Albardi state. Everything authored here is
provisional gameplay.
"""
